      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "活动参加者们都带着笑容离开。\n他们一定也会亲自去赛场――我能这样感觉到。",
      "source_fingerprint": "52138be9a30d6928a83c27bba19ecaf9d779926be2b6b9577d63268de2f6db40",
