    {
      "uid": "zhcn:661ffdc75e48c9c5b907c8d6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然带着一整套训练用具，莱斯莱斯\n也许从一开始就打算训练。可是――",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb95e847e6e2d0f714883a1903624ba5fa402105e51c788061c9d49290e659c0",
