      "uid": "zhcn:2c28617435c0dd79a785509f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果是离特雷森学园很近的东京赛场，还能理解。\n然而中山赛场，是需要转乘电车才能到的距离。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb09956215a6d710251d551c9ae5b8a0a3a78fd84ed70d391775d2eccdb096bf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1103/storytimeline_041103002.json",
