      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45f5e4690873d0976a7587e6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但疑问本身已经解开了。她果然是为了把努力训练的样子\n展示给活动参加者，才特地来到中山赛场的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a58fa79fbcc5dbc8eabdf6193e7cbe1bcf974bbeef04d2172ec3f9b0760069c1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1103/storytimeline_041103002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9351e078195992e7d21ff4a2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "某一天。我在下一场选拔赛的参赛名单中，\n发现了莱斯莱斯的名字。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbd51249b5de3858d0dc9656e69b7fa0512a1cd38a315493e43a686363eef394",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1103/storytimeline_041103002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99424fca1863014eeef88d3b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我很好奇她会跑出怎样的表现，\n于是来观看她的训练情况，可是――",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5386f8c1812ec921743a7e050fd2b3f0edd16f6800450b1e4a35401f25ae24a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1103/storytimeline_041103002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:480a8aaee3475f9030090209",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "胜利奖券",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf9b1efecb14e46d153e2ddf7d077e5a0a9e0a4345e01355c5dc33bb97cfb15a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1103/storytimeline_041103002.json",
      "json_path": [
