    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7fc6ba111cace92724d68a3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯，今天戴的是隐形眼镜。话说回来，\n各位训练员，选拔赛最受瞩目的果然还是那3人吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4604a29fd1940e15903f8bd7fabbd0378c77a6cff6b91417fe7966392797c60",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
